            "review_text": "Robyn257\nGold Coast, Australia71 contributions\n0\nDon't order the Spoon Pizza unless you like sweet cake!\nSep 2014 • Couples\nOur initial visit for a quick bite involved some fried chicken which was ok but the accompanying fried rice was bland and tasteless. Our second visit (out of convenience after getting back late from a day-long tour) involved the Spoon Pizza with potato on a sweet cake base. Even with the chili oil was very disappointing. Also, be advised that the house wine is actual a quite rough shochu Korean type wine. Probably our fault for not investigating prior to ordering but in the end quite disappointing.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 12, 2014",
