            "review_text": "Victorianlad\nMelbourne, Australia18287 contributions\n0\nSucculent chicken\nMay 2014 • Couples\nThis restaurant was not busy at Saturday lunchtime.\n\nIt is roomy and nicely decorated with knick knacks. Toilets were clean.\n\nI had a tasty watermelon juice and the BBQ chicken platter accompanied by vegetables. The chicken was delicious while the multicoloured capsicum had also been barbequed. An Hanoi beer went well with the chicken. The bill was VND287000.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 19, 2014",
